<section class="section contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="contact-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container contact-layout">
    <div class="contact-copy" data-reveal><span class="section-kicker light-kicker">Start a review</span><h2 id="contact-title">Take Control of Your Digital Content</h2><p>If your copyrighted content is being reproduced or distributed without authorization, DMCA Vision can help you organize the information needed to review the issue and determine appropriate next steps.</p><div class="contact-points"><div><span>01</span><p><b>Share the source</b><small>Tell us what you own and where it appears.</small></p></div><div><span>02</span><p><b>Request a review</b><small>We’ll assess the information and available next steps.</small></p></div></div><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button button-sm" href="#review-form">Submit an Infringement</a><a class="button button-sm button-ghost" href="mailto:contact@dmcavision.com">Contact DMCA Vision</a></div><a href="mailto:contact@dmcavision.com" class="contact-email">contact@dmcavision.com <span>↗</span></a></div>
    <form class="contact-form" id="review-form" data-contact-form data-reveal>
      <div class="form-head"><div><small>Infringement review</small><h3>Tell us about the issue</h3></div><span>Review request</span></div>
      <div class="form-grid"><label>Full Name <span>*</span><input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label><label>Business / Organization<input type="text" name="organization" autocomplete="organization" /></label><label>Email <span>*</span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label><label>Website<input type="url" name="website" inputmode="url" placeholder="https://" /></label><label>Type of Content <span>*</span><select name="contentType" required><option value="" selected disabled>Select content type</option><option>Images & Photography</option><option>Video & Media</option><option>Written Content</option><option>Creative Assets</option><option>Software & Digital Products</option><option>Brand Content</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Infringing URL <span>*</span><input type="url" name="infringingUrl" inputmode="url" placeholder="https://" required /></label></div>
      <label>Additional Information<textarea name="details" rows="4" placeholder="Briefly describe the protected work and suspected unauthorized use."></textarea></label>
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="accuracy" required /><span>I confirm that the information I submit is accurate to the best of my knowledge.</span></label>
      <button class="button form-submit" type="submit">Request Review <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      <p class="form-note">By submitting this form, you acknowledge that this inquiry does not create an attorney-client relationship.</p><p class="form-status" data-form-status aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
